{"id": "EUVD-2026-101097", "enisaUuid": "9256b5e8-2e7b-3a5f-a1f7-fb4cc9a5f881", "description": "Gitea's organization-list API does not enforce the read:organization token scope. A token limited to another category, such as read:misc, can retrieve organization metadata visible to its owner. For a site administrator's token, the response can include Limited and private organizations, bypassing the intended restriction on the token's delegated access.", "datePublished": "2026-10-14T14:36:59", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T15:03:17", "baseScore": 4.3, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:N/A:N", "references": ["https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-ww9q-7j5q-hrv5", "https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.27.3/", "https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/39041", "https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/39058", "https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.27.3"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-70407"], "assigner": "Gitea", "epss": 0.32, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "be6c764f-2115-371a-83a3-d66af71b9777", "product": {"name": "Gitea", "vendor": {"name": "Gitea"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.27.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "65365a58-fffa-34a6-8908-af7dc76f9507", "vendor": {"name": "Gitea"}}], "isExploited": false}